# Pathways Within - Cursor Rules

## Design System (MANDATORY)

All UI code MUST follow the Pathways Within design system defined in `/docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`.

### Color Rules

**ALLOWED COLORS ONLY:**
- `navy-*` - Primary dark color (headings, text, dark backgrounds)
- `green-*` - Accent color (CTAs, success, active states)
- `breezy-*` - Light blue (info, pending states)
- `cream-*` - Light backgrounds
- `linen-*` - Borders, subtle backgrounds
- `white` - Card surfaces

**BANNED COLORS (DO NOT USE):**
- `sage-*` - FORBIDDEN
- `amber-*` - FORBIDDEN  
- `yellow-*` - FORBIDDEN
- `orange-*` - FORBIDDEN
- `stone-*` - FORBIDDEN (use navy/linen instead)

### Brand Colors (Hex)
- Navy: #01153D
- Green: #72A23B
- Breezy: #86A8E1
- Cream: #FAF9F7
- Linen: #F5F4F2

### Typography
- Headings: Clarendon (serif), semibold, text-navy
- Body: Raleway (sans), regular, text-navy or text-navy-400
- Only 2 font weights: 400 (regular) and 600 (semibold)

### Component Patterns
- Primary buttons: `bg-green text-white rounded-full`
- Secondary buttons: `bg-navy text-white rounded-lg`
- Cards: `bg-white rounded-lg border border-linen-300 shadow-sm`
- Focus states: `ring-green-500`
- Dark sidebar: `bg-gradient-to-b from-navy-900 via-navy to-navy-950`
- Active nav: `bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-green-600 shadow-lg shadow-green/20`

### Before Writing UI Code
1. Check `/docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md` for patterns
2. Use only allowed colors
3. Follow established component patterns
4. Verify no banned colors are introduced

## Project Structure

- `/apps/main` - Main marketing site
- `/apps/wisdom` - Therapy services site
- `/apps/wellness` - Wellness services site  
- `/apps/crm` - Internal CRM dashboard
- `/packages/ui` - Shared UI components
- `/docs` - Documentation

